        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Matuku gha kutua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela kutambukilo huwu, kukaia matuku gha kutua mbai, richacha ngelo ra wasi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "angu wandu wichakaia wekukunda weni, wilakie na pesa, wekukasa, wing'etere; wichakaia wedukana wandu, wisesikiragha wavi wawo, wisewadie chawucha ingi, wiseelie, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wisene wughoma; wichakaia wa machu, wizighiriagha, walaki, wibirie, wizamilwagha ni nicha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa mikalo, wisetalagha, wibandilo ni chongo, wikunde maseko kuchumba kumkunda Mlungu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wiko na fwana ya kumuobua Mlungu, ela wiarikana ndighi raro. Kuwiinjikie wandu sa awo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aghadi yawo, weko wandu wingiagha nyumba ra wandu, na kuwidwa wunyika waka wisedimagha kukumazira, widukie misigo ya kaung'a na kughenjwa ii chia na ii chia ni bea zima-zima; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawo wakufundisha tulituli, ela na jingi ndewidimagha kuvikia kuimanya iyo loli anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na sa iji koni Jane na Jambre weremtangalieghe Musa, niko koni na awo wandu wiitangalagha ija loli; wandu winonekie vongo, wiko na irumirio ja tee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.7.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuf. 7.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ndewichaaghenda kula, angu wukelu ghwawo ghuchawonwa ni wandu wose, seji ghwa Jane na Jambre ghorewonekieghe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mafundisho gha kutua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana kwamerie kunugha mafundisho ghapo, mwendo ghwapo, makusudi gha irangi japo, irumirio japo, kurumaghia kwapo, lukundo lwapo, kumanga kwapo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kutirirwa kwapo, wasi ghwapo, maza rerenipatireghe aja Antiokia, Ikonio na Lustera; seji neretiriroghe ngirumaghia, ela hata huwo Bwana ukanivuvua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
